id: pm-starter-session-refusal-code
title: Track missing native code for mandatory output-session envelope refusals
description: "A valid native outputSession with token_budget 256 and spent_tokens 0 can throw PmCliError with exitCode 2 and an empty context when mandatory receipts do not fit. The public PmReadOutputBudgetExceeded contract documents requested_budget_infeasible and structured recovery, but this thrown path provides no native code. The consumer reports host_refused without guessing from prose; increasing the task ceiling recovers. Upstream search found no matching issue. Report to the orchestrator; do not file an upstream issue in this task."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[1]: host-ux
created_at: "2026-10-29T02:35:44.681Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-29T02:35:44.681Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Host provides a structured discriminator and recovery for mandatory session-envelope refusal; consumer can narrow it without prose matching
